  "Measured per-session S4 output tokens on RECORDED real S2 geometry; the prompt inputs are identical across arms, so the delta is the output contract's effect.",
  "One call per arm per session (no production-run composition): model compliance in the wild is not measured here \u2014 it is OBSERVABLE per row via verbatim_reemissions / added_by_s4 / corrected_by_s4 / s4_delta_reemit_suspect.",
  "The S3 search block is reconstructed from the session's own S2 list (what production S4 sees after S2 is written), not a live graph read.",
  "model_id is the model REQUESTED; the served id is not recorded here.",
  "Accuracy / chunk@20 are the eval lane's gates and are NOT measured here."
